  "description": "The Vaporesso Armour G Vape Kit is a sleek, versatile pod mod kit designed for vapers who want power and portability in one device. Powered by a robust 3000mAh built-in battery, the Armour G can reach up to 80W, delivering impressive performance for a wide variety of vaping styles. Whether you prefer a mouth-to-lung (MTL) experience or direct-to-lung (DTL) vaping, this kit provides the flexibility to exceed your expectations. The Armour G features the latest Neo PULSE MODE and COREX technology for stronger output and enhanced flavour consistency. Its top airflow control and four adjustable levels allow for precise customisation of your draw. Paired with Vaporesso’s SSS Leak-Resistant Technology, this pod mod offers a clean, mess-free experience, ideal for vapers on the move. The Armour G’s 2ml pod (TPD version) is compatible with Vaporesso’s GTX coil range, offering options from 0.15ohm to 1.2ohm, so you can tailor your setup for either high-VG or high-PG e-liquids . The device sports a 0.96” TFT screen with three interactive themes, making it easy to monitor and customise your settings with its vibrant display. Externally, too, the Armour G is replete with intricate design choices that make this one of the most premium pod mod devices Vaporesso has ever made. It is made even more ergonomic with the addition of a luxurious leather panel studded with metallic discs for improved grip. A sleek Neon light strip adds energy and colour to the device. Its tactile metallic fire button is a joy to use and the inclusion of slider to lock and unlock the device helps prevent misfires. The Armour G’s user-friendly design and powerful performance make it an excellent choice for both new vapers and experienced users looking for a compact yet extremely versatile pod mod. Please Note: When filling your pod with vape liquid for the first time, allow the pod to sit for ten minutes before use. This will allow the e-liquid to better saturate the wicking material, a type of cotton, to prevent dry hits and ensure the best flavour and performance from your coil.",
